# .gitattributes — line ending normalization for cross-platform contributors.
# Without this, mixed CRLF/LF can sneak in from Windows checkouts and
# trip the lint-tsan-filter regex (which is line-anchored). Per CLAUDE.md
# the project is macOS-only but contributors may clone from any OS.

# Source code: force LF
*.swift          text eol=lf
*.m              text eol=lf
*.mm             text eol=lf
*.h              text eol=lf
*.c              text eol=lf
*.cpp            text eol=lf
*.py             text eol=lf

# Scripts (lint-anchored regex sensitive to line endings)
*.sh             text eol=lf
# ⚠️ ID-REVIEW-1049 第八轮（审核门 P2 confirmed）：`*.json` **原来没被锁**
#   ⇒ 抹白语料 `Scripts/test/blanking-corpus.json` 的 sha256 口径是
#   **文件原始字节** ⇒ Windows checkout（autocrlf）会把字节换成 CRLF
#   ⇒ 哈希对不上 ⇒ 契约脚本**误红** ⇒ ⇒ 锁一个**字节口径**的东西 ⇒
#   **必须**连它的字节口径一起锁。
*.json           text eol=lf
*.sh             text eol=lf
*.yml            text eol=lf
*.yaml           text eol=lf
*.toml           text eol=lf

# Documentation / localization
*.md             text eol=lf
*.strings        text eol=lf
*.stringsdict    text eol=lf

# Binary assets (no normalization)
*.png            binary
*.jpg            binary
*.jpeg           binary
*.icns           binary
*.dSYM/          binary
*.framework/     binary
*.app/           binary
*.tar.gz         binary
